      <p class="reader-note">You have travelled a long way in these pages&mdash;from discovering that the visible world is not the whole of reality, to standing as a son who shines. The Fourth Dimension was never a mystical experience to be chased. It is simply the daily life of a believer who has learned to see every circumstance through the reality of God's Kingdom, revealed in Jesus Christ. May you live there. And may those who watch your life see Him.</p>
